Integration of Tide Island with the Omarchy theme/wallpaper system.

ADDITION by the omarchy-tide-island plugin. This delta is ALREADY present in
the vendored tree under vendor/tide-island/ and is copied verbatim by
scripts/install-tide-runtime.sh; NO install script applies this file. It is
recorded here so the divergence from upstream Tide Island 1.0.41 stays
auditable. Paths are relative to vendor/tide-island/ (apply with -p1).

What changes:
  * NEW  share/tide-island/scripts/omarchy-bridge.sh - a small, testable
         bridge to Omarchy theme/background state and commands.
  * EDIT share/tide-island/qml/island/WallpaperPickerLayer.qml - when Omarchy
         is detected the picker lists the current theme backgrounds (applied
         through Omarchy) and adds a Themes tab to switch themes.

